{
  "id": "MAT.23",
  "number": "23",
  "bookId": "MAT",
  "reference": "Matayo 23",
  "copyright": "© 2021 KENBS",
  "verseCount": 39,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "23",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "MAT 23"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "23",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yeso ogosoera aborokia b’amariiko na Abafarisai",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "r"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "(Mar 12:38-40; Luk 11:37-54; 20:45-47)",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naende Yeso agateebia emeganda na aborokigwa baye,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aborokia b’amariiko na Abafarisai baikaransire ase ekerogo kia Musa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaki, amang’ana onsi bakobateebia, moyanare na koyabwata; korende, timokora buna barabwo bagokora.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inaki nigo bakoboa chigurube chindito, bachitweka ase amareko y’abanto, korende barabwo abanyene tibari gwancha gochitigeria nekiara kiabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ogokora kwabo gwonsi nigo bagokora ng’a barorwe nabaanto; nigo bakogareyia ebitinti biabo biriikire amariiko, naende batambeyia emebareero y’ogochabera chianga chiabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naende nigo banchete aase amasikani ase emeyega, na goikaransa aase ebirogo bi’amasikani ase chisinagogi,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na gokwanigwa n’amasikani ase chichiiro, na korokwa Omwarimu n’abanto.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende inwe timobaisa korokwa Omworokia, ekiagera Omwarimu oino noyomo, na inwe mwensi nabamo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naende timobaisa koroka monto ase ense tata, ekiagera Iso oino noyomo, oyore igoro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gose timobaisa korokwa abanene, ekiagera Omonene oino noyomo, nere Kristo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nere oyore omonene mono kobua ase more, nigo arabe omokoreri oino,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na oyo okweimokereria igoro nairanigwe inse, na ere oyokweirania inse naimokererigwe igoro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Korende obobe nobwaino, aborokia b’amariiko na Abafarisai, abang’ainereria! Ekiagera mwasiekeire abanto oborwoti bwa igoro; naki inwe abanyene timori gosoa, na baria barigeti gosoa, timori kobaa ribaga basoe. [",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obobe nobwaino, aborokia b’amariiko na Abafarisai, abang’ainereria! Ekiagera mokounereria chinyomba chi’abatakaanwa, na ase obong’ainereria mwasaba ogosaba ogotambe. Ase ayio, inamonyore ekiina ekere ekenene kobua.]",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obobe nobwaino, aborokia b’amariiko na Abafarisai, abang’ainereria! Ekiagera nigo mogosiongorokana enyancha na ense enyomo korigia omotunyani oyomo, na ekero abeire omotunyani, mwagera oba omwana bw’omorero o kare na kare ara kabere kobua inwe abanyene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Obobe nobwaino, abaraai emeuko, inwe abamogoteeba: Onde bwensi kararie emuma ase Hekalu, tari gento, korende onde bwensi kararie emuma ase etaabu ye Hekalu, bwesibire n’emuma yaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inwe abariri emeuko! Nkereki kere ekenene kobua: netaabu, gose ne Hekalu egokora etaabu ebe enchenu?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inwe nigo mogoteeba: Onde bwensi kararie emuma ase egesasiimero tari gento; korende onde bwensi kararie emuma ase ekeng’wanso kere igoro ase egesasiimero bwesibire nemuma yaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inwe emeuko! Nkere ki kere ekenene kobua: nesadaka, gose negesasiimero kegokora esadaka ebe enchenu?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaki, oyorarie emuma ase egesasiimero nigo ararie ase ekio, na ase ebinto bionsi ebire igoro yaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na oyo orarie emuma ase Hekalu, nigo ararie ase eyio na ase oyo omenyete imeo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na oyo orarie emuma ase igoro, nigo ararie ase ekerogo ki’obonene kia Nyasae na ase oria ogeikaranserete.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Obobe nobwaino, aborokia b’amariiko na Abafarisai, abang’ainereria ekiagera nigo mokorua ensemo ya ikomi ye chiarare, na ebinsari, ne chinyeni chinde, na mwatiga amang’ana ayare amanene y’ogochika na oboronge, na amaabera, na okwegena. Naro ayio nabagwenerete moyakore, amo na gotatiga ayande.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inwe abaraai emeuko, mwakenonora egechuni, mwamera engamia!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Obobe nobwaino, aborokia b’amariiko na Abafarisai, abang’ainereria! Ekiagera nigo mogosibia egekombe na esani korwa isiko, korende ime biaichoire nobouri na okogania gotari nekerengo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye Omofarisai omouko! Sibia ritang’ani egekombe na esani ime, erio nonya nisiko binyare koba ebirabu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Obobe nobwaino, aborokia b’amariiko na Abafarisai, abang’ainereria! Ekiagera nigo mogwekaine nechimbeera chiakire echooka; na chirochio isiko chirorekana ng’a nechingiya, korende ime nigo chiichire namauga y’ebitondo, na euramba",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "yonsi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nainwe nabo more, isiko mwarorekana ase abanto ng’a nabaronge more, korende ime yaino mwaichoirwe nobong’ainereria na ebibe ebinge.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Obobe nobwaino, aborokia b’amariiko na Abafarisai, abang’ainereria! Ekiagera nigo mokoagaacha chimbeera chi’ababani, na kobaria chimbeera chi’abaronge,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mogoteeba: Onye ntwarengeo kare ase amatuko ye chisokoro chiaito, anga titwabwatanete nabarabwo ase ogoitera amanyinga y’ababani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Igo mwetebire inwe abanyene, ng’a inwe nabana babo more, baria baitete ababani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaki bono, ichoria ekerengo gie chisokoro chiaino.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inwe ching’iti, oroiboro rw’echinchoka, naki morakore motame ekiina ki’omorero o kare na kare!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio natomire ababani ase more, na abanto abang’aini, na aborokia b’amariiko; abande babo inamobaite na kobaabamba, na abande babo inamobang’wanie emecharichi ase chisinagogi chiaino, na kobachanda omochie ase omochie.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio nario arabachere amanyinga onsi ayaboronge ayaitegete ase ense, korwa amanyinga y’Abeli, oria omonyene oboronge, goika amanyinga a Zakaria, omwana o Barakia, oria mwaiterete gati ye Hekalu na egesasiimero.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekeene nabateebirie ng’a amang’ana aya onsi naache igoro ase ekegori eke.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yeso ogwechandera omochie o Yerusalemu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "r"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "(Luk 13:34-35)",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aye Yerusalemu, Yerusalemu, omochie ogoita ababani na kobaaka amagena abatomirwe ase ore! Ng’ara karenga narigirie gosangereria abana bao, buna engoko egosangereria ebichuchu biaye ase chimbaaba chiaye ime, korende timwancha!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rora, enyomba yaino mwatigeirwe ritombe",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na inche nabateebirie, timokondora naende nonya ng’ake goika ekero keria morache goteeba: Nasesenirie oyogocha ase erieta ri’Omonene.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.39"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
